                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5531/381a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Secretary of State,
                        Temporarily in Useppa, Florida</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-02-25">February 25, 1935</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Forthomme impressed upon me today importance of signing Belgian agreement before
                    executive authority to sign expires on February 28th. After this date powers
                    revert to Parliament. He fears debates in Parliament and unfavorable reaction
                    resulting possibly in defeat of agreement owing to terms as modified and slight
                    concessions to Belgium.</p>
                <p>Shall call you on telephone 10 o’clock tomorrow. Have today sent text of
                    agreement to President.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
